{"ayah/31-6.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:6 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na miongoni mwa watu wapo wanao nunua maneno ya upuuzi, ili wawapoteze watu na njia ya Mwenyezi Mungu pasipo kujua, na wanaichukulia ni maskhara. Hao watap\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:6 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na miongoni mwa watu wapo wanao nunua maneno ya upuuzi, ili wawapoteze watu na njia ya Mwenyezi Mungu pasipo kujua, na wanaichukulia ni maskhara. Hao watap\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/31.html\">Sura Luqman</a> › Aya 6</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Luqman 31:6</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمِنَ النَّاسِ مَن يَشْتَرِي لَهْوَ الْحَدِيثِ لِيُضِلَّ عَن سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ بِغَيْرِ عِلْمٍ وَيَتَّخِذَهَا هُزُوًا أُولَٰئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مُّهِينٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na miongoni mwa watu wapo wanao nunua maneno ya upuuzi, ili wawapoteze watu na njia ya Mwenyezi Mungu pasipo kujua, na wanaichukulia ni maskhara. Hao watapata adhabu ya kuwafedhehesha.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><h3>Aliyoyanukuu kutoka kwa wengine</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن مسعود</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «والله الذى لا إله غيره هو الغناء -يرددها ثلاث مرات.»<cite>«إغاثة اللهفان من مصايد الشيطان» 1/240</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s31a6\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-15.html\">Aya inayofuata (31:15)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-15.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:15 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na pindi wakikushikilia kunishirikisha na ambayo huna ilimu nayo, basi usiwat&#x27;ii. Lakini kaa nao kwa wema duniani, nawe ishike njia ya anaye elekea kwangu.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:15 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na pindi wakikushikilia kunishirikisha na ambayo huna ilimu nayo, basi usiwat&#x27;ii. Lakini kaa nao kwa wema duniani, nawe ishike njia ya anaye elekea kwangu.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/31.html\">Sura Luqman</a> › Aya 15</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Luqman 31:15</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِن جَاهَدَاكَ عَلَىٰ أَن تُشْرِكَ بِي مَا لَيْسَ لَكَ بِهِ عِلْمٌ فَلَا تُطِعْهُمَا وَصَاحِبْهُمَا فِي الدُّنْيَا مَعْرُوفًا وَاتَّبِعْ سَبِيلَ مَنْ أَنَابَ إِلَيَّ ثُمَّ إِلَيَّ مَرْجِعُكُمْ فَأُنَبِّئُكُم بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na pindi wakikushikilia kunishirikisha na ambayo huna ilimu nayo, basi usiwat&#x27;ii. Lakini kaa nao kwa wema duniani, nawe ishike njia ya anaye elekea kwangu. Kisha marejeo yenu ni kwangu Mimi, na Mimi nitakuambieni mliyo kuwa mkiyatenda.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فلهذا لم يجز أن يطاع مخلوق في معصية الخالق،<cite>«الحسنة والسيئة» 1/98</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s31a15\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-6.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (31:6)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-18.html\">Aya inayofuata (31:18)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-18.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:18 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Wala usiwabeuwe watu, wala usitembee katika nchi kwa maringo. Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu hampendi kila anaye jivuna na kujifakhirisha.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:18 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Wala usiwabeuwe watu, wala usitembee katika nchi kwa maringo. Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu hampendi kila anaye jivuna na kujifakhirisha.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/31.html\">Sura Luqman</a> › Aya 18</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Luqman 31:18</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَا تُصَعِّرْ خَدَّكَ لِلنَّاسِ وَلَا تَمْشِ فِي الْأَرْضِ مَرَحًا إِنَّ اللَّهَ لَا يُحِبُّ كُلَّ مُخْتَالٍ فَخُورٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Wala usiwabeuwe watu, wala usitembee katika nchi kwa maringo. Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu hampendi kila anaye jivuna na kujifakhirisha.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالفخر يشبه غمط الناس فإن كليهما تكبر على الناس.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/220</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وأما بطر الحق - وهو جحده ودفعه - فيشبه الاختيال الباطل فإنه تخيل أن الحق باطل بجحده ودفعه.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/220</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s31a18\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-15.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (31:15)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-21.html\">Aya inayofuata (31:21)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-21.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:21 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na wanapo ambiwa: Fuateni aliyo yateremsha Mwenyezi Mungu, husema: Bali tunafuata tuliyo wakuta nayo baba zetu. Je! Ijapo kuwa Shet&#x27;ani anawaita kwenye adh\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:21 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na wanapo ambiwa: Fuateni aliyo yateremsha Mwenyezi Mungu, husema: Bali tunafuata tuliyo wakuta nayo baba zetu. Je! Ijapo kuwa Shet&#x27;ani anawaita kwenye adh\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/31.html\">Sura Luqman</a> › Aya 21</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Luqman 31:21</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ اتَّبِعُوا مَا أَنزَلَ اللَّهُ قَالُوا بَلْ نَتَّبِعُ مَا وَجَدْنَا عَلَيْهِ آبَاءَنَا أَوَلَوْ كَانَ الشَّيْطَانُ يَدْعُوهُمْ إِلَىٰ عَذَابِ السَّعِيرِ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na wanapo ambiwa: Fuateni aliyo yateremsha Mwenyezi Mungu, husema: Bali tunafuata tuliyo wakuta nayo baba zetu. Je! Ijapo kuwa Shet&#x27;ani anawaita kwenye adhabu ya Moto uwakao?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذه مناظرة حكاها الله بين المسلمين والكفار فإن الكفار لجأوا إلى تقليد الآباء وظنوا أنه منجيهم لإحسانهم ظنهم بهم<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 4/173</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s31a21\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-18.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (31:18)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-25.html\">Aya inayofuata (31:25)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-25.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:25 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na ukiwauliza: Nani aliye ziumba mbingu na ardhi? Bila ya shaka watasema: Mwenyezi Mungu. Wewe sema: Alhamdulillahi! Sifa njema zote ni za Mwenyezi Mungu. \">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:25 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na ukiwauliza: Nani aliye ziumba mbingu na ardhi? Bila ya shaka watasema: Mwenyezi Mungu. Wewe sema: Alhamdulillahi! Sifa njema zote ni za Mwenyezi Mungu. \">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/31.html\">Sura Luqman</a> › Aya 25</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Luqman 31:25</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُم مَّنْ خَلَقَ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضَ لَيَقُولُنَّ اللَّهُ قُلِ الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ بَلْ أَكْثَرُهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na ukiwauliza: Nani aliye ziumba mbingu na ardhi? Bila ya shaka watasema: Mwenyezi Mungu. Wewe sema: Alhamdulillahi! Sifa njema zote ni za Mwenyezi Mungu. Lakini wengi wao hawajui.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">كانوا يقرون بأن الله خالق كل شيء وربه ومليكه؛ كما أخبر الله عنهم في القرآن في غير موضع<cite>«الاستغاثة في الرد على البكري» 1/158</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولهذا يحتج عليهم به على توحيد إلهيته<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/96</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهو توحيد الربوبية الذي اعترف به مشركو العرب، ولم يخرجوا به عن الشرك،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/96</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s31a25\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-21.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (31:21)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-27.html\">Aya inayofuata (31:27)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-27.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:27 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na lau kuwa miti yote iliyomo duniani ikawa ni kalamu, na bahari (ikawa wino), na ikaongezewa juu yake bahari nyengine saba, maneno ya Mwenyezi Mungu yasin\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:27 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na lau kuwa miti yote iliyomo duniani ikawa ni kalamu, na bahari (ikawa wino), na ikaongezewa juu yake bahari nyengine saba, maneno ya Mwenyezi Mungu yasin\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/31.html\">Sura Luqman</a> › Aya 27</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Luqman 31:27</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَوْ أَنَّمَا فِي الْأَرْضِ مِن شَجَرَةٍ أَقْلَامٌ وَالْبَحْرُ يَمُدُّهُ مِن بَعْدِهِ سَبْعَةُ أَبْحُرٍ مَّا نَفِدَتْ كَلِمَاتُ اللَّهِ إِنَّ اللَّهَ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na lau kuwa miti yote iliyomo duniani ikawa ni kalamu, na bahari (ikawa wino), na ikaongezewa juu yake bahari nyengine saba, maneno ya Mwenyezi Mungu yasingeli kwisha. Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu ni Mwenye nguvu, Mwenye hikima.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالأبحر إذا قدرت مدادا تنفد وكلمات الله لا تنفد؛ ولهذا قال أئمة السنة لم يزل الله متكلما كيف شاء وبما شاء<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/304</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فاخبر عن عدم نفاد كلماته لعزته وحكمته وهذان وصفان ذاتيان له سبحانه وتعالى<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/351</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن الآية سيقت لبيان أن أشجار الأرض لو كانت أقلاما والبحار مدادا فكتبت بها كلمات الله لنفدت البحار والأقلام ولم تنفد كلمات الله<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 1/57</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإذا كانت الملازمة ثابتة على هذا التقدير الذي هو أبلغ تقدير يكون في نفاد المكتوب فثبوتها على غيره من التقادير أولى<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 1/57</cite></blockquote><h3>Aliyoyanukuu kutoka kwa wengine</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الربيع بن أنس</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «وذكر ابن أبي حاتم في تفسيره عن سليمان بن عامر قال سمعت الربيع بن أنس يقول إن مثل علم العباد كلهم في علم الله عز وجل كقطرة من هذه البحور كلها»<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/351</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s31a27\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-25.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (31:25)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-32.html\">Aya inayofuata (31:32)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-32.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:32 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na wimbi linapo wafunika kama wingu, wao humwomba Mwenyezi Mungu kwa kumsafia dini. Lakini anapo waokoa wakafika nchi kavu, wapo baadhi yao huenda mwendo w\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:32 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na wimbi linapo wafunika kama wingu, wao humwomba Mwenyezi Mungu kwa kumsafia dini. Lakini anapo waokoa wakafika nchi kavu, wapo baadhi yao huenda mwendo w\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/31.html\">Sura Luqman</a> › Aya 32</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Luqman 31:32</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِذَا غَشِيَهُم مَّوْجٌ كَالظُّلَلِ دَعَوُا اللَّهَ مُخْلِصِينَ لَهُ الدِّينَ فَلَمَّا نَجَّاهُمْ إِلَى الْبَرِّ فَمِنْهُم مُّقْتَصِدٌ وَمَا يَجْحَدُ بِآيَاتِنَا إِلَّا كُلُّ خَتَّارٍ كَفُورٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na wimbi linapo wafunika kama wingu, wao humwomba Mwenyezi Mungu kwa kumsafia dini. Lakini anapo waokoa wakafika nchi kavu, wapo baadhi yao huenda mwendo wa sawa. Wala hazikanushi Ishara zetu ila aliye khaini kafiri mkubwa.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر أنهم مقرون بربوبيته، وأنهم مخلصون له الدين إذا مسهم الضر في دعائهم واستعانتهم،<cite>«قاعدة جامعة في توحيد الله وإخلاص الوجه والعمل له عبادة واستعانة» 1/68</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s31a32\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-27.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (31:27)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-34.html\">Aya inayofuata (31:34)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-34.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:34 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Hakika kuijua Saa (ya Kiyama) kuko kwa Mwenyezi Mungu. Na Yeye ndiye anaye iteremsha mvua. Na anavijua viliomo ndani ya matumbo ya uzazi. Na haijui nafsi y\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Luqman 31:34 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Hakika kuijua Saa (ya Kiyama) kuko kwa Mwenyezi Mungu. Na Yeye ndiye anaye iteremsha mvua. Na anavijua viliomo ndani ya matumbo ya uzazi. Na haijui nafsi y\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/31.html\">Sura Luqman</a> › Aya 34</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Luqman 31:34</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ اللَّهَ عِندَهُ عِلْمُ السَّاعَةِ وَيُنَزِّلُ الْغَيْثَ وَيَعْلَمُ مَا فِي الْأَرْحَامِ وَمَا تَدْرِي نَفْسٌ مَّاذَا تَكْسِبُ غَدًا وَمَا تَدْرِي نَفْسٌ بِأَيِّ أَرْضٍ تَمُوتُ إِنَّ اللَّهَ عَلِيمٌ خَبِيرٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Hakika kuijua Saa (ya Kiyama) kuko kwa Mwenyezi Mungu. Na Yeye ndiye anaye iteremsha mvua. Na anavijua viliomo ndani ya matumbo ya uzazi. Na haijui nafsi yoyote itachuma nini kesho. Wala nafsi yoyote haijui itafia nchi gani. Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu ndiye Mwenye kujua, Mwenye khabari.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالساعة هنا: معلومة، لا عالمة،<cite>«الحسنة والسيئة» 1/137</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s31a34\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/31-32.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (31:32)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/31.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Sura Luqman — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Sura Luqman — Maana ya Qur&#x27;ani kwa maneno ya Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/31.html\">\n<link 